  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lifesaving humanitarian assistance to people affected by Super Typhoon Doksuri</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing humanitarian needs, alleviate suffering, and increase dignity of the most at risk women, children, and men affected by Super Typhoon (STY) Doksuri in Cagayan Province. An integrated package of assistance consisting of cash and services to support access to food and basic needs, Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH), and gender and protection services will be delivered to 31,391 people.</narrative>
  </description>
